cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  This repository only documents how to reproduce a workflow run. If you use the
  workflow, please cite the ORIGINAL workflow listed under `references`, not this
  reproduction guide.
title: "RNA-seq analysis workflow (HISAT2, RS1) — Kubernetes reproduction guide"
abstract: >-
  Deployment and run instructions (Kubernetes manifests and Nextflow config) for
  reproducing the RNA-seq analysis workflow (HISAT2, RS1). The workflow code
  itself is upstream and is not redistributed here.
type: software
authors:
